    "records": [
      {
        "id": "R0026753_338d82712c",
        "ordinal": 26753,
        "source": "He has been watching her, concern growing on his face, and at last he gasps. \"Mattie!\" He turns and grabs you. \"The Bloom is hurting her, and even if she has done those horrible things and killed people, they deserved it... well, probably deserved it. Might have deserved it? Maybe they didn't.\" He wrenches himself away from that chain of thought. \"But the point is that she's our friend, and friends help each other!\"\r\n\r\n{ERRITIS}",
        "metadata": {
          "group": "conversations/c_bloom",
          "note": "资源定位仅表示存储位置，不证明说话者身份或剧情先后。",
          "resource": "en/text/conversations/c_bloom/c4121_secret_maw.stringtable#ID=67/DefaultText",
          "scene": "c_bloom/c4121_secret_maw.stringtable",
          "text_type": "对白或叙述（具体类型以本句为准）"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "R0026760_2ff0b03d5f",
        "ordinal": 26760,
        "source": "He puts his hands on his hips and scowls at you. \"I would like to inform you that when *I* scream like that, I'm not fine. And letting Mattie scream like that is not fine either.\" He crosses his arms. \"Not fine at *all*.\"",
        "metadata": {
          "group": "conversations/c_bloom",
          "note": "资源定位仅表示存储位置，不证明说话者身份或剧情先后。",
          "resource": "en/text/conversations/c_bloom/c4121_secret_maw.stringtable#ID=74/DefaultText",
          "scene": "c_bloom/c4121_secret_maw.stringtable",
          "text_type": "对白或叙述（具体类型以本句为准）"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "R0026803_1fbeec2e3b",
        "ordinal": 26803,
        "source": "His sergeant, Ranard, bows his head in loyalty to you, secretly too terrified of you and your brethren to refuse anything you'd ask.",
        "metadata": {
